The statute's retention rule states that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-3504669b95353e658773088e86e3b268451e3a98 "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years before shredding[[cite:obs-f51dafdb5bd96fa2aa096faab61453f3bfafff08 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].